{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-158","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-talk-403818170-line","text":"在你面前有两扇门，一扇由青铜铸造，庄严古朴，另一扇由黄金雕琢，熠熠生辉。自从你误入迷宫深处，已经与这两扇门对峙了整整一天。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-talk-403818171-line","text":"身为云游四海的冒险家，你当然见过那些雅努斯祭祀利用「门径」穿越天堑，但是门一旦打开，则再也无回头的可能。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-talk-403818172-line","text":"所幸你不用面对「选A还是选B」的经典困境，你还有第三个选择，靠自己的双腿走出去。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-text-4173575969003275835-choice","text":"打开青铜门。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-text-6361500601285195576-choice","text":"打开黄金门。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-text-15122313687092704862-choice","text":"哪扇都不开。","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-text-12159027816566563398-effect","text":"离开","speaker":""},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-158-talk-403818173-line","text":"「这一定是雅努斯的阴谋！」你嘟囔着消失在迷宫的黑暗中。","speaker":"模拟宇宙"}]}
